#show-only-what-you-need","content":"Value"},"2746":{"id":"/optimize/results-18","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#show-only-what-you-need","content":"Output"},"2747":{"id":"/optimize/results-19","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#show-only-what-you-need","content":"`all` (default)"},"2748":{"id":"/optimize/results-20","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#show-only-what-you-need","content":"Patch, skill diff, gate decision, skip info, and per-case rollouts"},"2749":{"id":"/optimize/results-21","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#show-only-what-you-need","content":"`patches`"},"2750":{"id":"/optimize/results-22","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#show-only-what-you-need","content":"The raw JSON patch the optimizer proposed (`patch.json`)"},"2751":{"id":"/optimize/results-23","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#show-only-what-you-need","content":"`diffs`"},"2752":{"id":"/optimize/results-24","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#show-only-what-you-need","content":"Unified diff between consecutive skill versions — see Diffs"},"2753":{"id":"/optimize/results-25","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#show-only-what-you-need","content":"`gate`"},"2754":{"id":"/optimize/results-26","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#show-only-what-you-need","content":"The accept/reject decision and scores (`gate.json`)"},"2755":{"id":"/optimize/results-27","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#show-only-what-you-need","content":"`skips`"},"2756":{"id":"/optimize/results-28","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#show-only-what-you-need","content":"Edit-budget info derived from `update.json` — see Skips"},"2757":{"id":"/optimize/results-29","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#patches","content":"`patch.json` is an array of edits the optimizer proposed for this step:"},"2758":{"id":"/optimize/results-30","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#interpreting-the-gate","content":"`gate.json` records the accept/reject decision for the step:"},"2759":{"id":"/optimize/results-31","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#interpreting-the-gate","content":"`score` is the candidate's score for this step; `best_score` is the best seen so far in the\nrun. A patch is accepted only if it improves on the incumbent by at least `gate_epsilon`\n(see the configuration reference). When a step is rejected the\nskill document is left unchanged and no new version is written."},"2760":{"id":"/optimize/results-32","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#skips","content":"There is **no `skips.json` artifact**. Skip information is derived from `update.json`,\nwhich records how the step's edit budget was spent:"},"2761":{"id":"/optimize/results-33","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#skips","content":"`budget` is the number of edits the step was allowed to apply, `chosen` the indices of the\npatches it actually applied, and `skipped_count` how many proposed patches were dropped for\nexceeding that budget. This is about *patches* dropped by the edit budget, not eval cases\nskipped for timeout or error."},"2762":{"id":"/optimize/results-34","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#diffs-and-skill-versions","content":"Versioned skill documents live at `<run>/skills/skill_v{NNNN}.md`, not in the step\ndirectory."},"2763":{"id":"/optimize/results-35","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#diffs-and-skill-versions","content":"**A new version is written only when a step is accepted**, so version numbers count\n*accepted steps*, not steps. Once any step has been rejected they no longer line up with\nstep indices: if step 0 is rejected and step 1 accepted, step 1's diff is\n`skill_v0000.md → skill_v0001.md`, not `v0001 → v0002`."},"2764":{"id":"/optimize/results-36","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#diffs-and-skill-versions","content":"`--show diffs` therefore resolves the bracketing versions from `history.json` — counting\naccepted steps before the one you asked for — rather than assuming step N maps to version\nN. For a rejected step it reports that directly:"},"2765":{"id":"/optimize/results-37","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#diffs-and-skill-versions","content":"If the step isn't recorded in `history.json` at all, `inspect` says that instead of\nguessing."},"2766":{"id":"/optimize/results-38","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#rollouts","content":"`rollouts.json` holds the per-case scores behind the step's aggregate, surfaced under\n`--show all`:"},"2767":{"id":"/optimize/results-39","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#finding-a-step-to-inspect","content":"Use `status` to read the history table first, then pick the step you care about — the\nlargest positive delta, or the last accepted step before a regression:"},"2768":{"id":"/optimize/results-40","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#finding-a-step-to-inspect","content":"An empty table under a completed run means no training steps were recorded — see the\nzero-step warning in Running and monitoring."},"2769":{"id":"/optimize/results-41","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#export-the-best-skill","content":"When you're happy with the results, export the best skill document:"},"2770":{"id":"/optimize/results-42","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#export-the-best-skill","content":"This copies `best_skill.md` from the run directory to the destination path. Parent\ndirectories are created if they don't exist."},"2771":{"id":"/optimize/results-43","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#export-the-best-skill","content":"**Note:** `best_skill.md` is the highest-scoring skill document seen across all accepted\nsteps — not necessarily the final step. If the last few steps were rejected, it reflects the\nbest earlier checkpoint. A run where nothing was accepted exports the seed document, with\nthe optimizer's protected-region markers added."},"2772":{"id":"/optimize/results-44","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#artifacts-reference","content":"Each step directory (`<run>/steps/step_{NNNN}/`) contains:"},"2773":{"id":"/optimize/results-45","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#artifacts-reference","content":"File"},"2774":{"id":"/optimize/results-46","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#artifacts-reference","content":"Description"},"2775":{"id":"/optimize/results-47","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#artifacts-reference","content":"`patch.json`"},"2776":{"id":"/optimize/results-48","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#artifacts-reference","content":"Array of edits proposed by the optimizer (`op`, `target`, `content`, `impact`)"},"2777":{"id":"/optimize/results-49","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#artifacts-reference","content":"`gate.json`"},"2778":{"id":"/optimize/results-50","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/